{"n": 23, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "23.webp", "text": "BMW MAINTENANCE SYSTEM\n00 00259 BMW Satety Test\n\nCall faults in diagnosis system and brief test.\n\nSteering Test:\nSteering gear, linkage, coupling, connections, leaks, oll volume,\ntghiness and condition of drive belt for power steering.\n\nBrake Test:\n\nBrake pads (remove/install wheels, lubricate centers), brake\ndiscs, pipes, hoses, connections, fluid level, parking brake\ncables, parking brake adjustment.\n\nWith rear brake discs: break in parking brake.\n\nImportant!\n\nReplace brake fluid every two years at the latest.\n\nTire and Wheel Rim Test:\nCondition, specified size and type, tread depth, wear pattern,\nlire Inflation pressure (including spare wheel).\n\nLight Test:\n\nHeadlights and front fog lamps (also aiming), parking lights,\ntall lights, backup lights, license plate lights, Instrument and\nsign lights, control and warning lamps (ABS and airbag).\n\nSignal Test:\nHorns, turn signals, hazard warning lights, stop lights, head-\nlight tlasher and rear fag lights,\n\nWindshield Wiper/Washer Test:\n\nWiper blades, washer (windshield, If applicable headlights),\nwashing fluid tank (leveV/antifreeze concentration),\n\nnozzle aiming (windshield, if applicable headtights). If appli-\ncable, fill Intensive cleaning fluid tank.\n\nSeat Belt Test:\nCondition and operation.\n\nRemarks:\nRepairs and adjustments are invoiced separately.\n\nSeo operating instructions\nof BMW diagnosis system.\n\nUse approved oll,\n\nUse approved brake fluid.", "words": [["BMW", 0.0922, 0.118, 0.1165, 0.1293], ["MAINTENANCE", 0.1201, 0.1194, 0.196, 0.13], ["SYSTEM", 0.2001, 0.1187, 0.2432, 0.13], ["00", 0.0912, 0.1492, 0.1023, 0.1605], ["00259", 0.1059, 0.1492, 0.1373, 0.1605], ["BMW", 0.1494, 0.1499, 0.1758, 0.1598], ["Satety", 0.1793, 0.1492, 0.2102, 0.1631], ["Test", 0.2138, 0.1499, 0.2345, 0.1611], ["Call", 0.0917, 0.185, 0.1104, 0.1963], ["faults", 0.1135, 0.1857, 0.1403, 0.1963], ["in", 0.1439, 0.1857, 0.153, 0.1